  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "The filmmaker James Fox says that an unnamed military man, whom he calls \"military X\", told him that \"everything that happened\" in Varginha \"started at my farm.\" Varginha is a town in Brazil where, in 1996, witnesses say a strange creature was seen and captured by soldiers. Fox tells Michels he heard this himself while working on his documentary Moment of Contact, and if the man is right, the whole Varginha affair began on his own land."
